WEBVTT

00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:11.867
Bottom line: use Copilot Studio as a governed agent platform, moving from business intent to useful action while funding workflows that merit scale, with rigor.

00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:17.500
Copilot Studio is a low-code studio for building and managing agents.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:24.567
Teams create agents, workflows and agent flows tied to business data, systems and work channels.

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:28.400
Generative orchestration is the decision layer.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:36.667
It lets an agent choose topics, tools, knowledge or other agents, ask for missing input, and then compose the response.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.467
Tools are where intent turns into action.

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:50.467
Govern connectors, agent flows, prompts, REST APIs, MCP and computer use for both modern apps and legacy screens under policy.

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:54.700
Scale only with enterprise controls attached.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:01:04.600
Data policies, audit logs, Agent 365, Entra identities, spend controls and evaluations keep the platform managed at scale.
